        <hr noshade size="1">
        
<font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> <BR>The Honor system is in on test server but apparently they forgot the part about gaining shards from pvp for Warlocks, oh yeah and most classes at rank 2 in the honor system now get trinkets that break cc. For rogues they break charm fear and polymorph. We Locks get to break poly, charm and fear, all of which we could do already if we had the fellhunter out. What we don't get is to break the rogues stuns, which are our primary weakness. New Succy looks good, new Dreadmist helm looks partly good (the cowl and glowing eyes) but is ruined by having this big floating flapping thing behind it. New Quests for enslaveable high end demins but at the same time confirmation that the enslave Warlocking was intentional and is gonna stay awhile making high end summons useless except as fire and forget missles (infernal) in pvp. </P><P>As for Hunters, they lose 20% pet DPS right off the top on test server. They gain two (broken) pet abilities that speed up their pets in exchange for a general Warlocking to pet speeds. They lose the ability to drain mana from druids who are shifted even while the Druids can regain mana while shifted.</P><P>Rogues on the other hand got buffed because we all know how rare and fragile they are.</P><P></font> 

